# Automatic split policy for class work-vm, read by `monitor-split auto`
# (vm-autofit runs it after every layout change). This file is a yadm
# alternate: only a machine whose `yadm config local.class` is work-vm gets
# ~/.config/monitor-split/policy, and without that file monitor-split auto
# changes nothing. Another machine opts in with its own policy##class.<name>.
#
#   LAYOUT OUTPUT-GLOB
#
# The first connected output matching the glob whose size equals the layout's
# canvas is split; every other output stays whole. Fusion's "Use All Displays
# in Full Screen" presents the external 4K as one 3840x2160 Virtual-N output.
home Virtual-*
